#: dtime.cpp:98
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""

#: dtime.cpp:122
#, kde-format
